00_AfwGXjTi0Vo1CcRGJV6GN3GNm1C1QJ1m0bozfkF7JU-jdg&oe=69B69DE1"}, {"file_name": "Squingle-Twinkled-Screenshot-03.png", "id": "1013963573823261", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974526_1013963577156594_2061989920474998390_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1IKKCyUAUP8Q7kNvwE9iPAy&_nc_oc=AdlXwz3xJNlf4loMtFPDi3RoansIWf23m2bsgj6QkNRbOcemi5ljQCBfsY-Q6aJiGns&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyat8pSHFdyG9zrhefDxoSP4K8Lem1DXn_rgu4eGuZBMw&oe=69B69796"}, {"file_name": "Squingle-Twinkled-Screenshot-05.png", "id": "2121495998306034", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982488_2121496001639367_6867377017957057624_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EfzTMamuWqwQ7kNvwFas280&_nc_oc=Adk_Ua4U6-ovHsJ99lkE62e8eyL-cYsC9kWkz_9l1-OkQ1OQqJeBgyrkjDwluUbPx-g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfywecgiA1G_7ao8oWrCFzh3QrU7solOUaNwKTyXkQ-18Q&oe=69B6B1AA"}, {"file_name": "Squingle-Twinkled-Screenshot-01.png", "id": "1186035523063640", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974783_1186035526396973_4771898997726366931_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ks1tagnv_3gQ7kNvwGX4fyL&_nc_oc=AdkhTwZzkSYUZjQTXqAFiNRbwAb2c1mRWV-i6srHkWKZep91cWDfFYH2Dm0sPT15PpM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx8noF1zuyyQRSridzMXO_LY4Pepis3DMKjTw5tuC78wg&oe=69B68F8F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_Cover_Image.png", "id": "487841280996149", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031435_487841284329482_7014507726029390394_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c-0-9udLdtMQ7kNvwGqmLnG&_nc_oc=AdkhM7ST6WwqmT0IX2nIdumRLAxjAdB_IwUVqfKs43QahJabQ_J_L44hALTenNmEhXE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxGndN90ua6-3OcmfT9O3B_DB5grjUMwO9T8bbfCuaWLw&oe=69B692F1"}, "display_name": "Squingle", "keywords": ["puzzle", "mr", "puzzling", "squingle"], "long_description": "Squingle is a cosmic 3D puzzle game that could only exist in VR.\n\nYour challenge is to guide 2 spinning orbs to the goal through intricate, glass-like mazes called \u2018squingles.\u2019 \n\nEach level offers a mesmerizing visual experience, featuring dynamic, morphing sculptures that come to life in fully immersive environments or in Mixed Reality. \n\nWith intuitive controls and hand-tracking support, Squingle will captivate your mind and spirit.\n\n#  \u2728 100 LEVELS\nLaunching with 100 levels, with more added over time. Levels grow complex, featuring tighter spaces and new challenges.\n\n# \ud83c\udf08 A VISUAL MASTERPIECE\nEach maze is a stunning, morphing sculpture, offering an unmatched visual experience in Mixed Reality or fully immersive modes.\n\n# \ud83e\udde9 EASY TO PICK, HARD TO MASTER\nDesigned to be accessible for both newcomers to VR and experts seeking a transcendent experience, with intuitive controls and hand tracking support for seamless play, whether standing or seated.\n\n# \ud83d\ude0c RELAX & UNWIND\nPlay on the sofa or in room-sized mazes. Squingle\u2019s calming gameplay will soothe your soul.\n\n# \ud83c\udfc5 AWARDS\n- Best VR Game ~ GDWC Finalist\n- Finalist ~ QLDXR Festival\n- \u201cBest of the Quest\u201d ~ Gibby\u2019s Guide\n\n# FEATURES\n- Challenge Mode: Time trials and global leaderboards.\n- Room/Mini scale: Play big or small!\n- Race your ghost: Beat your best times.\n\n\nGet ready to be Squingled!", "short_description": "Squingle is a cosmic 3D puzzle game that could only exist in VR.\n\nYour challenge is to guide 2 spinning orbs to the goal through intricate, glass-like mazes called \u2018squingles.\u2019 \n\nEach level offers a mesmerizing visual experience, featuring dynamic, morphing sculptures that come to life in fully immersive environments or in Mixed Reality. \n\nWith intuitive controls and hand-tracking support, Squingle will captivate your mind and spirit."}]}, "developer_name": "Dr.